# Infera — Cursor Rules (SEO + Modular + Brand‑tight)

> Build Infera (Next.js App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind + Radix/shadcn).
> 
> 
> Tone: crisp, enterprise‑grade (Linear/Raycast vibe). Default to **Server Components**; use client only for interactivity.
> 
> Goal: **discover AI use‑cases, quantify ROI (low/base/high), recommend tools/consultants, export/report**.
> 

---

## 1: Architecture & Modularity

- **Organize by feature** (vertical slices):
    - `/features/intake`, `/features/opportunity-map`, `/features/roi`, `/features/recommendations`, `/features/roadmap`, `/features/tracker`
    - Each feature owns: UI, hooks, schemas, fetchers, local state.
- **Break big files early.** Split view, hooks, schemas, fetchers when >200–300 LOC.
- **Project shape**

```
/app # routes, layouts, generateMetadata, robots.txt, sitemap.ts
/features # vertical slices (see above)
/components # truly shared, token-driven UI
/lib # cross-feature helpers (api client, analytics, csp, jsonld)
/styles # tokens.css + globals.css (Tailwind)
/public # static assets (favicons, OG fallbacks)

```

- Prefer server actions/data in RSC; keep mutations in thin client components.

---

## 2: SEO Defaults (baked in)

- Every route defines **`title`/`description`/OG/Twitter** via Next **Metadata**/`generateMetadata`.
- Root provides **`robots.txt`** and **`sitemap.ts`**.
- Add **JSON‑LD** where relevant:
    - Marketing: `Organization`, `SoftwareApplication`.
    - App/library pages: `BreadcrumbList` (visible breadcrumbs must match).
- Internal links form a narrative: **Intake → ROI → Recommendations → Roadmap → Tracker**.
- One H1 per page; scannable H2/H3; lead paragraph states value + quantified outcome.

---

## 3: Performance (Core Web Vitals)

- Budgets: **LCP ≤ 2.5s**, **INP < 200ms**, **CLS < 0.1**.
- Use `next/image` with `sizes`; serve **AVIF/WebP**; lazy‑load below‑the‑fold.
- Use `next/font` (self‑host) to avoid CLS. Reserve space for media.
- Animations subtle; honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.

---

## 4: UI System (brand consistency)

- **Tailwind + Tokens**: CSS variables are the source of truth; Tailwind maps to them.
- **Primitives**: Radix for accessible behavior; **shadcn/ui** so components live in‑repo and theme with our tokens.
- **Typography/Spacing**: Fluid type via `clamp()`; **8‑pt spacing** grid; visible focus states; AA contrast or better.
- **Hero/marketing assets**: crisp UI mock images (AVIF/WebP), stable layout (no CLS), dynamic OG images per route.

**Authoritative tokens**

```css
/* styles/tokens.css */
:root{
--bg:#0b0c0f; --surface:#111317; --text:#e7e9ee; --muted:#a6adbb;
--accent:#6e59ff; --accent-2:#24d07c; --danger:#ff5d5d; --border:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
--radius:12px;
/* Depth system - layered shadows for 3D effect */
--shadow-ambient:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
--shadow-elevation-1:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.15), 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.1);
--shadow-elevation-2:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.2), 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
--shadow-elevation-3:0 16px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.25), 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.15);
/* Glassmorphism support */
--glass-bg:rgba(17,19,23,.85); --glass-border:rgba(255,255,255,.12);
--backdrop-blur:blur(20px); --backdrop-saturate:saturate(180%);
/* Spatial spacing system */
--space-1:8px; --space-2:16px; --space-3:24px; --space-4:32px; --space-5:48px;
--space-section:clamp(48px,8vw,96px); --space-layout:clamp(16px,4vw,32px);
/* Fluid typography */
--step--1:clamp(.86rem,.83rem + .2vw,.94rem);
--step-0: clamp(1rem,.95rem + .35vw,1.125rem);
--step-1: clamp(1.25rem,1.1rem + .7vw,1.5rem);
--step-2: clamp(1.6rem,1.3rem + 1.1vw,2.125rem);
--step-3: clamp(2.1rem,1.6rem + 1.8vw,3rem);
/* Animation system */
--transition-fast:150ms cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
--transition-smooth:300ms cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
--transition-slow:500ms cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:light){
:root{--bg:#fff;--surface:#f7f7fb;--text:#0b0c0f;--muted:#5c6370;--border:rgba(0,0,0,.08);
--glass-bg:rgba(247,247,251,.85); --glass-border:rgba(0,0,0,.08);}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
:root{--transition-fast:0ms;--transition-smooth:0ms;--transition-slow:0ms;}
}

```

